  <item>
    <title>全网呼叫山东人！曾经梦想着“快乐向前冲”的少年，至今还没冲上赛道！如今播客喊话节目组！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6687b5590bc5d7cc700c5fc2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6687b5590bc5d7cc700c5fc2</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Jul 2024 08:56:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎来到828房间！</span><br><span>此刻……</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里是2008年的828房间~</span></p><span></span><p><span>那些曾经风靡一时现在却销声匿迹的它们……你们还好么？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>QQ农场</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;MP3&nbsp;</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>磁带</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>超女</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;抢车位</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;摩尔庄园</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;赛尔号</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;三国杀</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;步步高音乐手机</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>还珠格格</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>PSP游戏机</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;阿狸</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;漫画party</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>艺术创想</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>&nbsp;超级变变变&nbsp;</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>还有专属山东让人的“快乐向前冲”……</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>有没有属于你的童年？</span></p><span></span><p><span>有没有属于你的青春呢?</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期节目噶姐和松哥录的时候很兴奋，录完都沉默了许久……</span></p><span></span><p><span>那些老物件那么亲切那么熟悉 如今哪儿去了？</span></p><span></span><p><span>录制的时候回想起来这一桩桩一件件 一幕幕 在脑子里跑来跑去 光是想起来都感觉美好的想笑，笑过之后心里又泛着酸味~</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天在828房间里噶姐和松哥接见了两位贵客！</span><br><span></span><strong><span>你好！12岁的噶姐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>你好！10岁的松哥</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgfMDmTQWO2-LBGGcuSQEw3xXfFb.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpNfTmqZ9H_1G_bgGriwHdIDuI8e.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
